# Pre-commit stays fast: lint-staged only (FE-157). It formats the staged
# files with prettier and lints the staged ts/vue with eslint (cached,
# zero warnings); the masks live in the root package.json "lint-staged"
# block. The full gate (`pnpm -r verify`) is not run here any more -- it
